DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
29331::$$$message_0212_0000_0000$$$::A purple serpent sips blood.[lr]::
29332::$$$message_0212_0000_0001$$$::3:00 AM.[lr]::
29333::$$$message_0212_0000_0002$$$::Tonight, a one-sided slaughter began again.::
29334::$$$message_0212_0001_0000$$$::The stage was the now-lifeless Miyama, as usual.[lr]::
29335::$$$message_0212_0001_0001$$$::Every means of execution is employed, with the changes in methods occurring every instant the mood shifts.[lr]::
29336::$$$message_0212_0001_0002$$$::Skewering by large, stake-like daggers.[lr]::
29337::$$$message_0212_0001_0003$$$::Death by hanging from the streetlights. Squeezed to death by chains.[lr]::
29338::$$$message_0212_0001_0004$$$::Sometimes she goes overboard and makes a mess.[lr]::
29339::$$$message_0212_0001_0005$$$::On a whim, she grabs one with her hand and crushes its skull whole.[lr]::
29340::$$$message_0212_0001_0006$$$::There are myriad ways.[lr]::
29341::$$$message_0212_0001_0007$$$::She tries something she saw in a comic book, picking up a large vehicle and using it to crush them. [l]Sometimes there are handy tools at the nearby construction site.::
29342::$$$message_0212_0002_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
29343::$$$message_0212_0002_0001$$$::Steadying her uncontrolled breathing, she considers whether to return or continue.[lr]::
29344::$$$message_0212_0002_0002$$$::If memory serves, her objective was to investigate this abnormality.::
29345::$$$message_0212_0003_0000$$$::The resumed Holy Grail War.[lr]::
29346::$$$message_0212_0003_0001$$$::She had been bounding through the night in search of its cause and true nature.[lr]::
29347::$$$message_0212_0003_0002$$$::It was somewhat productive.[lr]::
29348::$$$message_0212_0003_0003$$$::However, despite surveilling a certain Servant from Shinto, she hadn't learned any clues.[lr]::
29349::$$$message_0212_0003_0004$$$::There is one major difference between her and the other Servants.::
29350::$$$message_0212_0004_0000$$$::The monsters roaming the night...[lr]::
29351::$$$message_0212_0004_0001$$$::No one should be able to notice them until the final day, but she has been aware of them since the beginning.[lr]::
29352::$$$message_0212_0004_0002$$$::She left the house on her own to investigate them, and has been examining them one by one as described above.[lr]::
29353::$$$message_0212_0004_0003$$$::She feels nothing in particular about it.[lr]::
29354::$$$message_0212_0004_0004$$$::She can move automatically when she has to do something she isn't interested in.[lr]::
29355::$$$message_0212_0004_0005$$$::She halts her emotions and becomes a machine carrying out a predetermined task.::
29356::$$$message_0212_0005_0000$$$::That's why she finds this nighttime hunt neither interesting nor boring. It's just work.[lr]::
29357::$$$message_0212_0005_0001$$$::An eternally fruitless labor.[lr]::
29358::$$$message_0212_0005_0002$$$::She will run through the night, performing a task neither exciting nor tedious, until she gets results.[lr]::
29359::$$$message_0212_0005_0003$$$::And yet...[lr]::
29360::$$$message_0212_0005_0004$$$::When did even that start to go awry?::
29361::$$$message_0212_0006_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
29362::$$$message_0212_0006_0001$$$::She steadies her uncontrolled breathing.[lr]::
29363::$$$message_0212_0006_0002$$$::If she set her mind to it, she could complete this errand in half an hour.[lr]::
29364::$$$message_0212_0006_0003$$$::Actually, "would" is the appropriate word here.[lr]::
29365::$$$message_0212_0006_0004$$$::There's nothing to be gained no matter where she looks.[lr]::
29366::$$$message_0212_0006_0005$$$::In this sea of crimson, all she does is kill.[lr]::
29367::$$$message_0212_0006_0006$$$::She can't investigate any further. There is nothing to find. She needs to painstakingly examine each and every monster, but there are none left.::
29368::$$$message_0212_0007_0000$$$::"......"[lr]::
29369::$$$message_0212_0007_0001$$$::She steadies her uncontrolled breathing.[lr]::
29370::$$$message_0212_0007_0002$$$::Monsters they may be, but to her, they're no better than trash.[lr]::
29371::$$$message_0212_0007_0003$$$::A hundred or two don't even suffice as a warm-up.::
29372::$$$message_0212_0008_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
29373::$$$message_0212_0008_0001$$$::But she still has to steady her breathing.[lr]::
29374::$$$message_0212_0008_0002$$$::Panting, she chooses to continue tonight's investigation.[lr]::
29375::$$$message_0212_0008_0003$$$::...Just one more. I'll check out just one more.[lr]::
29376::$$$message_0212_0008_0004$$$::She convinces herself to keep going and bounds toward the next hunting ground.[lr]::
29377::$$$message_0212_0008_0005$$$::There is already a horde of a hundred monsters there.[lr]::
29378::$$$message_0212_0008_0006$$$::She's examined tens of thousands already, learning nothing from them. And yet, she continues the slaughter tonight.::
29379::$$$message_0212_0009_0000$$$::She mechanically bathes in the blood.[lr]::
29380::$$$message_0212_0009_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
29381::$$$message_0212_0009_0002$$$::Her breathing is starting to run wild again.[lr]::
29382::$$$message_0212_0009_0003$$$::...One more. I [font italic=true]want to check out[font italic=false] one more. Just one more.[lr]::
29383::$$$message_0212_0009_0004$$$::THIS CAN't be a baD thING To Do.[lr]::
29384::$$$message_0212_0009_0005$$$::They're just monsters, there's no end to them, and this was the task she was given.[lr]::
29385::$$$message_0212_0009_0006$$$::So she doesn't feel any doubts, much less meaning, [clfg][dash page=back textoff=0 mx=268 opacity=100 layer=base irot=-0.021 cx=255 imag=2.4 time=18000 cy=-30 mag=2.4 my=-1 storage=01月夜 rot=0.031 accel=0][fg lv2off=1 left=-100 index=2000 top=-425 storage=シネスコw1000a][fg lv2off=1 left=-100 index=3000 top=525 storage=シネスコw1000b][transex textoff=0 time=400]meaning, [wait canskip=0 time=400][noise monocro=0 type=ltDodge opacity=240]MEaNInG, [wait canskip=0 time=400]mEanINg, [wait canskip=0 time=400]mean...iNG, [wait canskip=0 time=400]about it [stopnoise]at all.::
29386::$$$message_0212_0010_0000$$$::They're clearly the ones who are wrong.[lr]::
29387::$$$message_0212_0010_0001$$$::If they don't want to die, then they should just not appear.[lr]::
29388::$$$message_0212_0010_0002$$$::But they boil up out of every nook and cranny like insects, so she has no choice but to take them all on.[lr]::
29389::$$$message_0212_0010_0003$$$::She wishes they would leave her alone, but she has to deal with them.::
29390::$$$message_0212_0011_0000$$$::...That's right. [l]Back at the very beginning, she didn't really want to do this, but she had no choice.[lr]::
29391::$$$message_0212_0011_0001$$$::There was something more precious to her than her objections, so she carried out her role.[lr]::
29392::$$$message_0212_0011_0002$$$::Still, she really didn't want to... So she tried to stop being a living creature and turn into a man-killing "trap" whenever she had to go to work.::
29393::$$$message_0212_0012_0000$$$::"Medusa? Where did she go? Isn't it time for her to come back?"[lr]::
29394::$$$message_0212_0012_0001$$$::It happened after the umpteenth job.::
29395::$$$message_0212_0013_0000$$$::"Come on, hurry up and come out. Stheno received a wonderful gift. We'll share it with you today."[lr]::
29396::$$$message_0212_0013_0001$$$::She became a trap for the humans who came to take her sisters by force.[lr]::
29397::$$$message_0212_0013_0002$$$::"...? What an awful smell... Medusa, are you there?"[lr]::
29398::$$$message_0212_0013_0003$$$::She didn't turn them to stone.[lr]::
29399::$$$message_0212_0013_0004$$$::Their carcasses, [wait canskip=0 time=500][dash hidefg=0 textoff=0 mx=0 opacity=255 layer=base irot=-0.03 cx=523 imag=1.7 time=100 cy=183 mag=1.7 my=0 storage=o形の無い島(暗黒)-(真紅) rot=-0.03 accel=0][noise monocro=1 type=ltDodge opacity=170]their carcasses, [wait canskip=0 time=500][stopnoise][dash hidefg=0 textoff=0 mx=0 opacity=255 layer=base irot=-0.11 cx=347 imag=1.7 time=100 cy=309 mag=1.7 my=0 storage=o形の無い島(暗黒)-(真紅) rot=-0.11 accel=0]she took their carcasses and...[rf]::
29400::$$$message_0212_0014_0000$$$::"...Medusa?[lr]::
29401::$$$message_0212_0014_0001$$$::What are you doing...?"[lr]::
29402::$$$message_0212_0014_0002$$$::The hunched figure startles, caught while sipping _____.[lr]::
29403::$$$message_0212_0014_0003$$$::...[wait canskip=0 time=500][se storage=se028 nowait=1][fadein textoff=0 time=200 storage=red][clfg][dash textoff=0 page=back mx=0 opacity=255 layer=base irot=-0.0 cx=348 imag=1.3 time=100 cy=682 mag=1.3 my=0 storage=o形の無い島(暗黒)-(真紅) rot=-0.0 accel=0][fg left=-100 index=3000 top=400 storage=シネスコw1000b][fg left=-100 index=2000 top=-300 storage=シネスコw1000a][fg opacity=0 left=0 index=1000 top=0 storage=red2][transex textoff=0 time=400]She doesn't want to remember.[lr]::
29404::$$$message_0212_0014_0004$$$::Those days...[lr]::
29405::$$$message_0212_0014_0005$$$::Her sister's eyes were always bright and joyful, but they turned white with fear...::
29406::$$$message_0212_0015_0000$$$::...She continues the feast in the name of "investigation."[lr]::
29407::$$$message_0212_0015_0001$$$::Her body grows more used to the task each time she repeats it.[lr]::
29408::$$$message_0212_0015_0002$$$::She's on an endless crescendo now.[lr]::
29409::$$$message_0212_0015_0003$$$::The monsters are stronger than humans, but still a far cry from being able to keep up with her. They're just right for her to crush.[lr]::
29410::$$$message_0212_0015_0004$$$::She feels a sensation of shifting into the next gear.[lr]::
29411::$$$message_0212_0015_0005$$$::From low to mid, and mid to high.[lr]::
29412::$$$message_0212_0015_0006$$$::If there's a problem, it's that there's no limit to how high her gears can go.[lr]::
29413::$$$message_0212_0015_0007$$$::Her body, her outer shell, will become unable to withstand the ever-increasing RPM.::
29414::$$$message_0212_0016_0000$$$::Why is she so immersed in her task?[lr]::
29415::$$$message_0212_0016_0001$$$::She thinks she must have ended up uncharacteristically prioritizing work because her enemies are weak, and the environment is ideal.[lr]::
29416::$$$message_0212_0016_0002$$$::After all, the town is uninhabited.[lr]::
29417::$$$message_0212_0016_0003$$$::The residents disappear at midnight.[lr]::
29418::$$$message_0212_0016_0004$$$::Did the monsters kill them all, or did they never exist to begin with?[lr]::
29419::$$$message_0212_0016_0005$$$::It must be the latter.[lr]::
29420::$$$message_0212_0016_0006$$$::The monsters attack humans, but she's never seen them killing a human.::
29421::$$$message_0212_0017_0000$$$::                  ...They only lay hands on those like themselves.[lr]::
29422::$$$message_0212_0017_0001$$$::                  They only show any interest, any hatred, for monsters like them.[rf]::
29423::$$$message_0212_0018_0000$$$::"...Huh?"[lr]::
29424::$$$message_0212_0018_0001$$$::That's why she was taken by surprise.[lr]::
29425::$$$message_0212_0018_0002$$$::She assumed that there would be no humans left once the monsters were out at night.[lr]::
29426::$$$message_0212_0018_0003$$$::So, when she saw a girl in the park...[lr]::
29427::$$$message_0212_0018_0004$$$::                            (even though she knew with a glance it was human)[rf][lr]::
29428::$$$message_0212_0018_0005$$$::...she didn't hesitate to impale it.::
29429::$$$message_0212_0019_0000$$$::"......Hah."[lr]::
29430::$$$message_0212_0019_0001$$$::Her confusion and regret immediately faded.[lr]::
29431::$$$message_0212_0019_0002$$$::This town was always devoid of life.[lr]::
29432::$$$message_0212_0019_0003$$$::A human just happened to wander into it.[lr]::
29433::$$$message_0212_0019_0004$$$::The monsters would've gotten it, even if she didn't.[lr]::
29434::$$$message_0212_0019_0005$$$::So it's okay.[lr]::
29435::$$$message_0212_0019_0006$$$::She sighs, acknowledging that she committed a trivial, meaningless error.::
29436::$$$message_0212_0020_0000$$$::"...It's not okay.[lr]::
29437::$$$message_0212_0020_0001$$$::No matter what sort of creature you are and what this situation is, [l][say storage=emimp30_kar_0002 name=カレン]you killed a human being."[lr]::
29438::$$$message_0212_0020_0002$$$::The girl should be dead, but her mouth announces the sin in a singing voice.::
29439::$$$message_0212_0021_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
29440::$$$message_0212_0021_0001$$$::She stands up.[lr]::
29441::$$$message_0212_0021_0002$$$::Her wounds don't close. She twitches and throbs.::
29442::$$$message_0212_0022_0000$$$::"Ah[line len=3]ahh, ah[line len=3]"[lr]::
29443::$$$message_0212_0022_0001$$$::The words are trapped in her throat.[lr]::
29444::$$$message_0212_0022_0002$$$::She craves oxygen.[lr]::
29445::$$$message_0212_0022_0003$$$::The sight alone makes her dizzy.[lr]::
29446::$$$message_0212_0022_0004$$$::Ahh, how fragrant! That red, delicious essence of life that I could never find no matter how many of those monsters I killed after searching high and low!::
29447::$$$message_0212_0023_0000$$$::"...You can't take it anymore, I see. If it's unbearable, then do as you please.[lr]::
29448::$$$message_0212_0023_0001$$$::After all...you came straight at me, a human, because [font italic=true]that's what you always wanted to do[font italic=false], right?"[lr]::
29449::$$$message_0212_0023_0002$$$::The voice carves into her chest.[lr]::
29450::$$$message_0212_0023_0003$$$::...Yes. The monsters are still milling around.[lr]::
29451::$$$message_0212_0023_0004$$$::But she ignored her targets and threw her daggers at the girl instead.::
29452::$$$message_0212_0024_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
29453::$$$message_0212_0024_0001$$$::She shakes her head no.[lr]::
29454::$$$message_0212_0024_0002$$$::Her hair writhes like a snake in pain.[lr]::
29455::$$$message_0212_0024_0003$$$::Desperately, she denies it as an accident,[lr]::
29456::$$$message_0212_0024_0004$$$::insisting that she has a different role.::
29457::$$$message_0212_0025_0000$$$::"A different role... You want to uncover the truth behind all this?[lr]::
29458::$$$message_0212_0025_0001$$$::What a bold-faced lie. You don't care at all about what's happening to this town."[lr]::
29459::$$$message_0212_0025_0002$$$::Her words open up her chest cavity, exposing her heart to the outside air.[lr]::
29460::$$$message_0212_0025_0003$$$::...Yes. She doesn't care about keeping the peace in the town.[lr]::
29461::$$$message_0212_0025_0004$$$::This was all for her Master...::
29462::$$$message_0212_0026_0000$$$::"My, what a loyal Servant.[lr]::
29463::$$$message_0212_0026_0001$$$::But is this [font italic=true]really[font italic=false] for her? I wonder..."[lr]::
29464::$$$message_0212_0026_0002$$$::"Ngh...!"[lr]::
29465::$$$message_0212_0026_0003$$$::The air is toxic. The girl approaches her, step by step.[lr]::
29466::$$$message_0212_0026_0004$$$::Not with her feet, but with words.[lr]::
29467::$$$message_0212_0026_0005$$$::Her space isn't being invaded, but her heart is.[lr]::
29468::$$$message_0212_0026_0006$$$::The objective now is to hit her crumbling body with the final stake.::
29469::$$$message_0212_0027_0000$$$::"...You must be exhausted after doing this for so many days.[lr]::
29470::$$$message_0212_0027_0001$$$::I'll let you rest now. I'm starting to get tired of watching it, to be honest."[lr]::
29471::$$$message_0212_0027_0002$$$::She throws the dagger at the girl's mouth.[lr]::
29472::$$$message_0212_0027_0003$$$::Her aim is perfect. The stake skewers the girl's head in a spray of blood and mangled tongue.[lr]::
29473::$$$message_0212_0027_0004$$$::And yet...::
29474::$$$message_0212_0028_0000$$$::"Just admit it, Medusa.[lr]::
29475::$$$message_0212_0028_0001$$$::...You resent them."[lr]::
29476::$$$message_0212_0028_0002$$$::(You resent humans.)[rf][lr]::
29477::$$$message_0212_0028_0003$$$::"You're actually enjoying this."[lr]::
29478::$$$message_0212_0028_0004$$$::(You're enjoying murder.)[rf][lr]::
29479::$$$message_0212_0028_0005$$$::"You simply..."[lr]::
29480::$$$message_0212_0028_0006$$$::(For no reason whatsoever...)[rf][lr]::
29481::$$$message_0212_0028_0007$$$::"...care about this more than you do about the person you claim to value."::
29482::$$$message_0212_0029_0000$$$::The girl doesn't fall.[lr]::
29483::$$$message_0212_0029_0001$$$::The purple snakes are drenched black in blood.::
29484::$$$message_0212_0030_0000$$$::"You may act like a machine, but the weight of the lives you've taken stays the same.[lr]::
29485::$$$message_0212_0030_0001$$$::The lost lives will not disappear [wvl][se storage=se290.wav]just because you avoid looking at them.[lr]::
29486::$$$message_0212_0030_0002$$$::If you keep living with all that bottled up inside you...there will come a day when you can't even recognize what you've become on the inside."::
29487::$$$message_0212_0031_0000$$$::"Ngh...!!!"[lr]::
29488::$$$message_0212_0031_0001$$$::What an eyesore.[lr]::
29489::$$$message_0212_0031_0002$$$::The assailant doesn't even care what this human is anymore. She's just an eyesore.[lr]::
29490::$$$message_0212_0031_0003$$$::So, she'll kill her until she shuts up.[lr]::
29491::$$$message_0212_0031_0004$$$::She rips open her lukewarm belly and tears out the entrails.[lr]::
29492::$$$message_0212_0031_0005$$$::She wants to shout for joy.[lr]::
29493::$$$message_0212_0031_0006$$$::She's never felt better about taking her anger out on this girl compared to all the other humans she's killed before!::
29494::$$$message_0212_0032_0000$$$::She dismantles the body starting from the stomach until only the head remains.[lr]::
29495::$$$message_0212_0032_0001$$$::Now the girl won't talk anymore.[lr]::
29496::$$$message_0212_0032_0002$$$::She feels a wave of relief, mixed with disappointment that she can't kill the girl again.[lr]::
29497::$$$message_0212_0032_0003$$$::"...Surely you understand now.[lr]::
29498::$$$message_0212_0032_0004$$$::Monsters should go back to where they belong."[lr]::
29499::$$$message_0212_0032_0005$$$::"..."[lr]::
29500::$$$message_0212_0032_0006$$$::Finally.[lr]::
29501::$$$message_0212_0032_0007$$$::She finally realizes her true feelings, her yearning to kill humans so badly it hurts.::
29502::$$$message_0212_0033_0000$$$::Once upon a time...[lr]::
29503::$$$message_0212_0033_0001$$$::...there was a princess who one day came to be hated by the people who once loved her. They exiled her to a faraway island.::
29504::$$$message_0212_0034_0000$$$::Nothing was on this island. It was a far cry from her colorful life from before.[lr]::
29505::$$$message_0212_0034_0001$$$::The princess was so scared of the people who got angry at her for no reason, she wished that no one else would ever come to the island.[lr]::
29506::$$$message_0212_0034_0002$$$::But she was so very lonely and sad. She didn't know what she'd done wrong.::
29507::$$$message_0212_0035_0000$$$::"Medusa, you would cry if you were all alone.[lr]::
29508::$$$message_0212_0035_0001$$$::As your family, we will never forgive this disgrace."[lr]::
29509::$$$message_0212_0035_0002$$$::After a while, her older sisters came to the island.[lr]::
29510::$$$message_0212_0035_0003$$$::"I don't care what happens to you, Medusa...but I do need a servant."::
29511::$$$message_0212_0036_0000$$$::How wonderful.[lr]::
29512::$$$message_0212_0036_0001$$$::The princess's sisters were loved by all, but they still chose to live with her on the island.::
29513::$$$message_0212_0037_0000$$$::Her loneliness faded.[lr]::
29514::$$$message_0212_0037_0001$$$::The island was still empty, but that was fine, as long as her sisters were here.::
29515::$$$message_0212_0038_0000$$$::Now she only feared the humans.[lr]::
29516::$$$message_0212_0038_0001$$$::Kill. Kill. Kill the monster.[rf][lr]::
29517::$$$message_0212_0038_0002$$$::They bravely came to drive the princess away.[lr]::
29518::$$$message_0212_0038_0003$$$::Take. Take. Take the goddesses.[rf][lr]::
29519::$$$message_0212_0038_0004$$$::As if that weren't enough, they even threatened her two sisters.[lr]::
29520::$$$message_0212_0038_0005$$$::The princess decided to retaliate, in order to protect her sisters.::
29521::$$$message_0212_0039_0000$$$::What a wonderful act of love.[lr]::
29522::$$$message_0212_0039_0001$$$::Yes. This time, [font italic=true]she would do to the humans what they did to her...![font italic=false]::
29523::$$$message_0212_0040_0000$$$::SHe kilLED manY HUMANs.[sestop time=100 nowait=1][fadebgm time=100 volume=100][lr]::
29524::$$$message_0212_0040_0001$$$::After all, [fadebgm time=100 volume=40][seloop storage=se407.wav]the princess had no place else to go.[lr]::
29525::$$$message_0212_0040_0002$$$::She didn't want anyone to come.[lr]::
29526::$$$message_0212_0040_0003$$$::She didn't want anyone to come.[lr]::
29527::$$$message_0212_0040_0004$$$::She just wanted them to leave her alone with her sisters, [sestop time=100 nowait=1][fadebgm time=100 volume=100]but...::
29528::$$$message_0212_0041_0000$$$::"Stop it, Medusa.[lr]::
29529::$$$message_0212_0041_0001$$$::It's the humans' own fault for showing up here to die.[lr]::
29530::$$$message_0212_0041_0002$$$::But you mustn't take pleasure in killing them."[lr]::
29531::$$$message_0212_0041_0003$$$::THeY kePt COminG, ONE AFtER AnoThEr.[lr]::
29532::$$$message_0212_0041_0004$$$::ThERE WAs No end TO THEM, [fadebgm time=100 volume=40][seloop storage=se407.wav]SO SHe sTARtED FIGurING oUt hOW tO kiLL theM FASteR, thrOUGh TrIal AND ERROr.[lr]::
29533::$$$message_0212_0041_0005$$$::Once the traps she invented started working well, she started to feel a little strange.[rf]::
29534::$$$message_0212_0042_0000$$$::"Your Mystic Eyes carry the power of prohibition itself.[lr]::
29535::$$$message_0212_0042_0001$$$::They were never meant to induce terror."[lr]::
29536::$$$message_0212_0042_0002$$$::But the people who always criticized the princess...[lr]::
29537::$$$message_0212_0042_0003$$$::began to rightfully fear her.[rf]::
29538::$$$message_0212_0043_0000$$$::"...Do not put that in your mouth.[lr]::
29539::$$$message_0212_0043_0001$$$::You're starting to scare us lately."[lr]::
29540::$$$message_0212_0043_0002$$$::No matter how infamous she grew, there was no end to the humans' tenacity.[lr]::
29541::$$$message_0212_0043_0003$$$::The princess's sisters scolded her,[lr]::
29542::$$$message_0212_0043_0004$$$::and the princess began to grow ashamed of what she now looked like,[lr]::
29543::$$$message_0212_0043_0005$$$::so she kept her distance from her beloved sisters...[rf]::
29544::$$$message_0212_0044_0000$$$::until she ended up all alone once again.[lr]::
29545::$$$message_0212_0044_0001$$$::She was so lonely, so sad, [fadebgm time=100 volume=100][sestop time=100 nowait=1]that she began to crave a new sacrifice.[lr]::
29546::$$$message_0212_0044_0002$$$::Come to think of it...[lr]::
29547::$$$message_0212_0044_0003$$$::...they were the first sacrifices. The thought made her blush and laugh.[rf][playstop time=3000 nowait=1]::
29548::$$$message_0212_0045_0000$$$::"Ha...ah... Ah...!"[rf][lr]::
29549::$$$message_0212_0045_0001$$$::She swings her daggers in ecstasy.[lr]::
29550::$$$message_0212_0045_0002$$$::She crushes them, laughing contemptuously.[lr]::
29551::$$$message_0212_0045_0003$$$::She runs as if fleeing something. There's no stopping her feet or her breathing now.::
29552::$$$message_0212_0046_0000$$$::"Ha... Haha, hahaha...!"[rf][lr]::
29553::$$$message_0212_0046_0001$$$::She feels dizzy every time she crushes one.[lr]::
29554::$$$message_0212_0046_0002$$$::Disgustingly dizzy.[lr]::
29555::$$$message_0212_0046_0003$$$::Dreadfully dizzy.[lr]::
29556::$$$message_0212_0046_0004$$$::Her obsession accelerates into mania, and before she knows it, she's butchering the monsters with single-minded enthusiasm.[lr]::
29557::$$$message_0212_0046_0005$$$::She doesn't want to think, so she just gives herself over to her natural, animal urges. The hunt is just too fun not to.::
29558::$$$message_0212_0047_0000$$$::The night goes on. The slaughter continues.[lr]::
29559::$$$message_0212_0047_0001$$$::There are no living humans in the town at night, only roaming monsters.[lr]::
29560::$$$message_0212_0047_0002$$$::And then, she breaks.[lr]::
29561::$$$message_0212_0047_0003$$$::With each kill, the burden on her body grew.[lr]::
29562::$$$message_0212_0047_0004$$$::Every time she pulped a monster, she forgot more and more words.::
29563::$$$message_0212_0048_0000$$$::She was destroying herself.[lr]::
29564::$$$message_0212_0048_0001$$$::"..., ..., [wvl canskip=0 time=800]......?"[rf][lr]::
29565::$$$message_0212_0048_0002$$$::It occurs to her to look down.[lr]::
29566::$$$message_0212_0048_0003$$$::Her body has returned to the way it looked [font italic=true]back then[font italic=false].::
29567::$$$message_0212_0049_0000$$$::"..."[rf][lr]::
29568::$$$message_0212_0049_0001$$$::She doesn't scream.[lr]::
29569::$$$message_0212_0049_0002$$$::Her boiling mind freezes at unbelievable speed.[lr]::
29570::$$$message_0212_0049_0003$$$::Ahh, I knew this would happen...[lr]::
29571::$$$message_0212_0049_0004$$$::She has no time to laugh or cry.[lr]::
29572::$$$message_0212_0049_0005$$$::In the interval it would have taken to do so, she's stabbed repeatedly.::
29573::$$$message_0212_0050_0000$$$::The wounded monsters surround her.[lr]::
29574::$$$message_0212_0050_0001$$$::The person she was is on the verge of death.[lr]::
29575::$$$message_0212_0050_0002$$$::A multitude of claws rip and tear, leaving nothing of her below the chest.[lr]::
29576::$$$message_0212_0050_0003$$$::Like mincemeat.[lr]::
29577::$$$message_0212_0050_0004$$$::All that remains of the dark husk of that female monster is her upper half, and her doom is only minutes away.::
29578::$$$message_0212_0051_0000$$$::"Ha... Haah, hah..."[rf][lr]::
29579::$$$message_0212_0051_0001$$$::While breathing raggedly, she looks at her bloody hands.[lr]::
29580::$$$message_0212_0051_0002$$$::Red and black.[lr]::
29581::$$$message_0212_0051_0003$$$::She swipes her claws, [se storage=se104.wav]the only vestige of what she used to be, at the monsters milling around her.[lr]::
29582::$$$message_0212_0051_0004$$$::...This dead enemy still has the power to fight back.[lr]::
29583::$$$message_0212_0051_0005$$$::The monsters calmly watch their new kindred die.::
29584::$$$message_0212_0052_0000$$$::"Hah... Hah, ah..."[rf][lr]::
29585::$$$message_0212_0052_0001$$$::It's hard to breathe.[lr]::
29586::$$$message_0212_0052_0002$$$::She should be dying, but her body won't stop changing.[lr]::
29587::$$$message_0212_0052_0003$$$::It probably won't stop even after her death.[lr]::
29588::$$$message_0212_0052_0004$$$::After she dies, the thing that used to be her will be reborn as a monstrous Anti-Hero that might not even resemble her, before disappearing.::
29589::$$$message_0212_0053_0000$$$::".........What am I..."[rf][lr]::
29590::$$$message_0212_0053_0001$$$::She whispers. The fact that she can still speak like a human is an irritating, lingering attachment.[lr]::
29591::$$$message_0212_0053_0002$$$::".........I knew..."[rf][lr]::
29592::$$$message_0212_0053_0003$$$::She stares dreamily at her hands, which are turning into a monster's limbs.[lr]::
29593::$$$message_0212_0053_0004$$$::...She knew this would happen.[lr]::
29594::$$$message_0212_0053_0005$$$::She admitted as much to him: [lr]::
29595::$$$message_0212_0053_0006$$$::Her current form was only temporary, and she would eventually end up as the hideous monster she truly was.::
29596::$$$message_0212_0054_0000$$$::Her doom was all but guaranteed.[lr]::
29597::$$$message_0212_0054_0001$$$::From the moment she first tasted a human's _____, this ending was certain.::
29598::$$$message_0212_0055_0000$$$::She grew, day by day.[lr]::
29599::$$$message_0212_0055_0001$$$::First her body collapsed, then her heart, and finally her very existence.[lr]::
29600::$$$message_0212_0055_0002$$$::She just wanted to become stronger to protect her sisters.[lr]::
29601::$$$message_0212_0055_0003$$$::But in the end, she saw even them as intruders in her nest.::
29602::$$$message_0212_0056_0000$$$::"Ah...agh..."[rf][lr]::
29603::$$$message_0212_0056_0001$$$::She doesn't know what happened to them.[lr]::
29604::$$$message_0212_0056_0002$$$::At the time, she had no eyes or nose or mouth. She had transformed into a realm that ground up all of its prey.[lr]::
29605::$$$message_0212_0056_0003$$$::No, that was what she did as a monster. It had nothing to do with what she was before she turned into one.[lr]::
29606::$$$message_0212_0056_0004$$$::So it shouldn't hurt.::
29607::$$$message_0212_0057_0000$$$::"Ah... [wvl canskip=0 time=600][dash textoff=0 mx=0 opacity=255 layer=base irot=-0.0 cx=400 imag=1.2 time=100 cy=300 mag=1.2 my=0 storage=re07b_ゴルゴン姉とメドゥーサ rot=-0.0 accel=0]Ahhh...!"[rf][lr]::
29608::$$$message_0212_0057_0001$$$::But it probably did.[lr]::
29609::$$$message_0212_0057_0002$$$::The mere thought of it makes her want to gouge out her own eyes.::
29610::$$$message_0212_0058_0000$$$::"What a foolish little sister..."[lr]::
29611::$$$message_0212_0058_0001$$$::The sacrifices came before the monster of their own accord.[lr]::
29612::$$$message_0212_0058_0002$$$::They held hands and stilled their trembling feet, gazing up at the completely changed monster.::
29613::$$$message_0212_0059_0000$$$::"...No, we sisters were foolish.[lr]::
29614::$$$message_0212_0059_0001$$$::We never asked you to protect us. You looked like you were having so much fun that we ended up spoiling you."[lr]::
29615::$$$message_0212_0059_0002$$$::The oldest sister Stheno's voice was like a melody.[lr]::
29616::$$$message_0212_0059_0003$$$::She smiled at the monster with the same affection she always showed.::
29617::$$$message_0212_0060_0000$$$::"Hmph. Speak for yourself.[lr]::
29618::$$$message_0212_0060_0001$$$::Stheno got desperate because she always gives up too quickly, but I was going to protect my chastity forever."[lr]::
29619::$$$message_0212_0060_0002$$$::Euryale, the second sister, looks indignant.[lr]::
29620::$$$message_0212_0060_0003$$$::Even as she scolds their sister, a look of pity crosses her face.::
29621::$$$message_0212_0061_0000$$$::"How marvelous. Are you satisfied now, Euryale?[lr]::
29622::$$$message_0212_0061_0001$$$::We remained pure until the end."[lr]::
29623::$$$message_0212_0061_0002$$$::Stheno grips Euryale's fingers tightly,[lr]::
29624::$$$message_0212_0061_0003$$$::as if trying to give her courage.[lr]::
29625::$$$message_0212_0061_0004$$$::As if reminding her not to run from their precious family.::
29626::$$$message_0212_0062_0000$$$::"...Yeah. I don't like it, but the alternative is becoming an idiot like her. At least this way, my end will mean something."[lr]::
29627::$$$message_0212_0062_0001$$$::The sacrifice thinks.[lr]::
29628::$$$message_0212_0062_0002$$$::The two of them despised humans, but their little sister never did.::
29629::$$$message_0212_0063_0000$$$::Men loved the sisters and swore to ravish them.[lr]::
29630::$$$message_0212_0063_0001$$$::Stheno thought of it as fate, while Euryale raged against it, but still resigned herself to it.[lr]::
29631::$$$message_0212_0063_0002$$$::And their youngest sister defended them from it all.::
29632::$$$message_0212_0064_0000$$$::"...You protected us.[lr]::
29633::$$$message_0212_0064_0001$$$::But the Medusa who protected us isn't here anymore.[lr]::
29634::$$$message_0212_0064_0002$$$::Then...let us all become the same."[lr]::
29635::$$$message_0212_0064_0003$$$::What is lost will never return.[lr]::
29636::$$$message_0212_0064_0004$$$::Stheno dreamed that they would live here forever on this island at the furthest reaches of the earth. She closed her eyes and raised her head.::
29637::$$$message_0212_0065_0000$$$::"...Wow, we're right in front of her now...[lr]::
29638::$$$message_0212_0065_0001$$$::Well, this is goodbye, my adorable Medusa.[lr]::
29639::$$$message_0212_0065_0002$$$::It seems my lips are becoming loose because I'm facing my end... But we're actually the ones who looked up to you."[lr]::
29640::$$$message_0212_0065_0003$$$::Past days will never happen again.[lr]::
29641::$$$message_0212_0065_0004$$$::Euryale believed that they would escape this rustic temple someday and go back home. She smiled like she used to and raised her head.::
29642::$$$message_0212_0066_0000$$$::                                              "STOp...stoP StoP StoP...!"[rf]::
29643::$$$message_0212_0067_0000$$$::Millions of snakes devoured the sacrifices.[lr]::
29644::$$$message_0212_0067_0001$$$::There was no joy or sadness to it.[lr]::
29645::$$$message_0212_0067_0002$$$::The monster ground them down to nothing, like ants swarming a piece of food.[lr]::
29646::$$$message_0212_0067_0003$$$::In the end, the immortal sisters...[lr]::
29647::$$$message_0212_0067_0004$$$::                              (who were beautifully sisterly until the very end...)[lr]::
29648::$$$message_0212_0067_0005$$$::both became a living part of the monster.::
29649::$$$message_0212_0068_0000$$$::Not a trace was left. They became the blood that would keep the monster moving.[lr]::
29650::$$$message_0212_0068_0001$$$::The three sisters of Gorgon[line len=2]the Dark Temple.[lr]::
29651::$$$message_0212_0068_0002$$$::The goddesses were banished to the Shapeless Isle and went on to become the monsters that the human tales speak of.::
29652::$$$message_0212_0069_0000$$$::"Ah...aaahhh, ah..."[rf][lr]::
29653::$$$message_0212_0069_0001$$$::What did she love?[lr]::
29654::$$$message_0212_0069_0002$$$::What did she want to have?[lr]::
29655::$$$message_0212_0069_0003$$$::She had so little that was precious to her, so she intended to protect them, no matter what.[lr]::
29656::$$$message_0212_0069_0004$$$::In her dying moments/[l]Utterly transformed,[lr]::
29657::$$$message_0212_0069_0005$$$::she can't remember at all.::
29658::$$$message_0212_0070_0000$$$::"Hah...agh..."[rf][lr]::
29659::$$$message_0212_0070_0001$$$::The transformation won't stop.[lr]::
29660::$$$message_0212_0070_0002$$$::At this rate, she'll become a monster and disappear.[lr]::
29661::$$$message_0212_0070_0003$$$::Then, it'll all be over.[lr]::
29662::$$$message_0212_0070_0004$$$::She will be summoned as a monster incarnate whose purpose is to eliminate humanity, not someone who protects humans.::
29663::$$$message_0212_0071_0000$$$::"..."[rf][lr]::
29664::$$$message_0212_0071_0001$$$::The transformation won't stop.[lr]::
29665::$$$message_0212_0071_0002$$$::...There's nothing she can do, and it doesn't matter.[lr]::
29666::$$$message_0212_0071_0003$$$::The swarm of monsters sound like they're having a festival.[sestop time=5000 nowait=1][lr]::
29667::$$$message_0212_0071_0004$$$::Their resentful voices herald the coming of a new monster.::
29668::$$$message_0212_0072_0000$$$::"..."[rf][lr]::
29669::$$$message_0212_0072_0001$$$::Her consciousness is fading away.[lr]::
29670::$$$message_0212_0072_0002$$$::...She feels like she has something left to do, but she can't achieve it.[lr]::
29671::$$$message_0212_0072_0003$$$::She'll just close her eyes, calmly, [noise monocro=0 type=ltDodge opacity=200]as her life runs out...[stopnoise][lr]::
29672::$$$message_0212_0072_0004$$$::"...Who's there?"[rf][lr]::
29673::$$$message_0212_0072_0005$$$::She realizes something unfamiliar is watching her.::
29674::$$$message_0212_0073_0000$$$::"Huh, you can see me?[lr]::
29675::$$$message_0212_0073_0001$$$::...I see. You're a monster now, too."[lr]::
29676::$$$message_0212_0073_0002$$$::The thing laughs in a familiar way. She has the vague sense that she's heard it before, but also that she's never heard this voice.[lr]::
29677::$$$message_0212_0073_0003$$$::A smirking mouth and mocking eyes.[lr]::
29678::$$$message_0212_0073_0004$$$::...She feels intense annoyance. Sadism bubbles up within her.[lr]::
29679::$$$message_0212_0073_0005$$$::If her body was intact, she'd wring its head off.::
29680::$$$message_0212_0074_0000$$$::"Ahh... No, not quite.[lr]::
29681::$$$message_0212_0074_0001$$$::You aren't something as clear-cut as that. [l][say storage=emimp30_anr_0012 name=アンリ]You're aware of what you are, aren't you?"[lr]::
29682::$$$message_0212_0074_0002$$$::Aware...?[lr]::
29683::$$$message_0212_0074_0003$$$::She isn't ready to go, but she accepts the facts.[lr]::
29684::$$$message_0212_0074_0004$$$::Her designation in the Throne of Heroes is going to change from the female Medusa to the monstrous Gorgon.::
29685::$$$message_0212_0075_0000$$$::"I see. How gracious.[lr]::
29686::$$$message_0212_0075_0001$$$::But it sounds like you don't know what makes a monster what they are.[lr]::
29687::$$$message_0212_0075_0002$$$::You see... Monsters don't attack people to live. They live to attack people. They're killing mechanisms that are completely opposite to human society and reject every iota of it. They're like a toxin whose very existence is harmful.[lr]::
29688::$$$message_0212_0075_0003$$$::That's what a monster is. Can you really say that you're one?"[lr]::
29689::$$$message_0212_0075_0004$$$::She knows. She's personified what she's about to become countless times.::
29690::$$$message_0212_0076_0000$$$::"...It's too late. I've always been..."[rf][lr]::
29691::$$$message_0212_0076_0001$$$::I've always been a monster.[lr]::
29692::$$$message_0212_0076_0002$$$::She just disguised herself with reason and beauty.[lr]::
29693::$$$message_0212_0076_0003$$$::...She'll eventually become a monster, so that must be her true nature.[lr]::
29694::$$$message_0212_0076_0004$$$::That's why it doesn't matter.[lr]::
29695::$$$message_0212_0076_0005$$$::She roamed the night in search of blood, and found herself immersed in slaughter.[lr]::
29696::$$$message_0212_0076_0006$$$::...A monster like her [stopnoise]was bound to shed its skin eventually.::
29697::$$$message_0212_0077_0000$$$::"...Ha."[lr]::
29698::$$$message_0212_0077_0001$$$::But it laughs.[lr]::
29699::$$$message_0212_0077_0002$$$::It finds this truly amusing.[lr]::
29700::$$$message_0212_0077_0003$$$::It finds this genuinely detestable.[lr]::
29701::$$$message_0212_0077_0004$$$::It laughs as if to scorn her, as she becomes a more grotesque monster with each passing minute.::
29702::$$$message_0212_0078_0000$$$::"Like I said, that's not what you are.[lr]::
29703::$$$message_0212_0078_0001$$$::Listen. A monster doesn't kill out of instinct. [l][say storage=emimp30_anr_0042 name=アンリ]It kills because [font italic=true]it has a superior mind.[font italic=false][lr]::
29704::$$$message_0212_0078_0002$$$::A monster uses all the superhuman abilities at its disposal to rejoice in killing, without a hint of doubt or sadness. [l][say storage=emimp30_anr_0044 name=アンリ]Someone who just ends up killing humans is a different creature.[lr]::
29705::$$$message_0212_0078_0003$$$::...And you're a half-baked creature that could go either way. [l][say storage=emimp30_anr_0046 name=アンリ]But hey, at least you still have time to pick either side."::
29706::$$$message_0212_0079_0000$$$::"..."[rf][lr]::
29707::$$$message_0212_0079_0001$$$::The thinking part of her that wanted to be gone moments ago reaches for the precipice of fate.[lr]::
29708::$$$message_0212_0079_0002$$$::She reaches for it, pathetically, wanting to remain on this earth.::
29709::$$$message_0212_0080_0000$$$::"[noise monocro=0 type=ltDodge opacity=180]...What...do you mean..."[rf][lr]::
29710::$$$message_0212_0080_0001$$$::"You still don't get it?[lr]::
29711::$$$message_0212_0080_0002$$$::A part of you craves blood, and another part of you cares about people.[lr]::
29712::$$$message_0212_0080_0003$$$::Both of them are real. You can't deny either side.[lr]::
29713::$$$message_0212_0080_0004$$$::There's no pros or cons to desire. Whichever is bigger or more important varies in the moment.[lr]::
29714::$$$message_0212_0080_0005$$$::What's key is whether you still have it or not."::
29715::$$$message_0212_0081_0000$$$::"...[noise monocro=0 type=ltDodge opacity=180]Have...what?"[stopnoise][rf][lr]::
29716::$$$message_0212_0081_0001$$$::She puts the tiniest shred of strength [noise monocro=0 type=ltDodge opacity=180]into her arms, which are reaching for the abyss.[stopnoise][lr]::
29717::$$$message_0212_0081_0002$$$::She's actually using every last drop of her remaining power, but it's a hopelessly insignificant amount.[lr]::
29718::$$$message_0212_0081_0003$$$::Not enough to pull herself back up.[lr]::
29719::$$$message_0212_0081_0004$$$::[noise monocro=0 type=ltDodge opacity=180]No matter how much she struggles, [stopnoise]she's going to disappear.[lr]::
29720::$$$message_0212_0081_0005$$$::The thing gazes down at her plight, chuckling.::
29721::$$$message_0212_0082_0000$$$::"Now I ask you, the Servant known as Rider...[lr]::
29722::$$$message_0212_0082_0001$$$::In your heart,[lr]::
29723::$$$message_0212_0082_0002$$$::is there still anything you desire?"::
29724::$$$message_0212_0083_0000$$$::   There's nothing she wants.[lr]::
29725::$$$message_0212_0083_0001$$$::But she did have a powerful wish.::
29726::$$$message_0212_0084_0000$$$::[font italic=true]"Monsters should go back to where they belong."[font italic=false][lr]::
29727::$$$message_0212_0084_0001$$$::That's exactly it. Even if she is Medusa now, she can't save the version of herself that becomes Gorgon.[lr]::
29728::$$$message_0212_0084_0002$$$::There was no saving her from the start.[lr]::
29729::$$$message_0212_0084_0003$$$::So there's nothing she wants.[lr]::
29730::$$$message_0212_0084_0004$$$::No matter how she spends her days, in the end she'll become a killing, devouring monster and leave nothing behind.::
29731::$$$message_0212_0085_0000$$$::                                 ...But.[lr]::
29732::$$$message_0212_0085_0001$$$::                                 There's still someone whom even I can save.::
29733::$$$message_0212_0086_0000$$$::...Servants are summoned by Masters who are like them.[lr]::
29734::$$$message_0212_0086_0001$$$::That's doubly true when the summoning catalyst is weak.[lr]::
29735::$$$message_0212_0086_0002$$$::She answered the girl's summons because they had similar destinies.[lr]::
29736::$$$message_0212_0086_0003$$$::She was fated to become a monster someday.[lr]::
29737::$$$message_0212_0086_0004$$$::As fellow monsters, victims who would one day become aggressors, they formed a bond...::
29738::$$$message_0212_0087_0000$$$::"Ah...ah[line len=2]"[rf][lr]::
29739::$$$message_0212_0087_0001$$$::That's why...[lr]::
29740::$$$message_0212_0087_0002$$$::She won't let that girl become like herself.[lr]::
29741::$$$message_0212_0087_0003$$$::There's nothing she can do to change herself now, but she can still protect the future of someone who has the same destiny.[lr]::
29742::$$$message_0212_0087_0004$$$::I never got to enjoy my own happiness.[lr]::
29743::$$$message_0212_0087_0005$$$::I never paid for my own sins.[lr]::
29744::$$$message_0212_0087_0006$$$::   She dearly loved that selfish, foolish girl's desperate show of courage...::
29745::$$$message_0212_0088_0000$$$::"..., [rf]...Huh?"[lr]::
29746::$$$message_0212_0088_0001$$$::She stares at her hands, astonished.[lr]::
29747::$$$message_0212_0088_0002$$$::The change has stopped, and she's disappearing as herself.::
29748::$$$message_0212_0089_0000$$$::"Why...?"[lr]::
29749::$$$message_0212_0089_0001$$$::"Because you aren't a monster.[lr]::
29750::$$$message_0212_0089_0002$$$::Sure, you're pathetic, [l][say storage=emimp30_anr_0072 name=アンリ]but as long as you want to save someone else, you still barely count as human."[rf][lr]::
29751::$$$message_0212_0089_0003$$$::She can hear the voice coming from somewhere.[lr]::
29752::$$$message_0212_0089_0004$$$::It seems to be nearby, but she can't see who's speaking.::
29753::$$$message_0212_0090_0000$$$::"Aww, man. It took care of itself.[lr]::
29754::$$$message_0212_0090_0001$$$::You'll keep wallowing in your worries forever, but as long as you still have that wish, you won't turn into a monster.[lr]::
29755::$$$message_0212_0090_0002$$$::Just like how your pain and suffering will last for all eternity, you'll never join this side."[rf][lr]::
29756::$$$message_0212_0090_0003$$$::The presence begins to fade.[lr]::
29757::$$$message_0212_0090_0004$$$::She can only see its silhouette. It waves farewell.::
29758::$$$message_0212_0091_0000$$$::"...Wait. [noise monocro=1 type=ltSubtractive opacity=100]You're..."[lr]::
29759::$$$message_0212_0091_0001$$$::She calls out to it, coughing blood.::
29760::$$$message_0212_0092_0000$$$::"Haha, you sure are persistent, snake lady. I'm impressed by your mettle, but you'd better just let yourself die this time.[lr]::
29761::$$$message_0212_0092_0001$$$::Once you wake up, apologize to your Master.[lr]::
29762::$$$message_0212_0092_0002$$$::I know this doesn't mean much coming from me, but a Master and Servant ought to get along."[rf][lr]::
29763::$$$message_0212_0092_0003$$$::The thing snickers before disappearing.[lr]::
29764::$$$message_0212_0092_0004$$$::...At the very end,[lr]::
29765::$$$message_0212_0092_0005$$$::she saw a boy she knows well in that thing.::
29766::$$$message_0212_0093_0000$$$::"...You're right."[lr]::
29767::$$$message_0212_0093_0001$$$::She sighs heavily.[lr]::
29768::$$$message_0212_0093_0002$$$::She lowers the arms that she had previously extended in order to reach for something.[lr]::
29769::$$$message_0212_0093_0003$$$::"...Truly, I've always been such a fool."::
29770::$$$message_0212_0094_0000$$$::This time, she closes her eyes.[lr]::
29771::$$$message_0212_0094_0001$$$::Relieved that she found her wish again on the cusp of death...[lr]::
29772::$$$message_0212_0094_0002$$$::"I'll be back soon, so... Please wait for me, [wvl][se storage=se137.wav]Sakura."[lr]::
29773::$$$message_0212_0094_0003$$$::...she speaks a promise she can't keep, and her beautiful form fades from the earth.::
929610::$$$message_9212_0058_0000$$$::"What a foolish little sister..."[r]::